      </div>
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--pm-cacao-600); margin: 22px 0 0;">More from the guide: <a href="/coffee-alternative-cacao" style="color: var(--pm-cacao-700); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">replacing coffee with cacao</a> and <a href="/mood-science-ceremonial-cacao" style="color: var(--pm-cacao-700); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">the mood science behind cacao</a>.</p>
    </div>
